	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.name": "果实乐趣手册",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tooltip": "一本记录水果、蜜蜂与仪式的手册。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.description": "欢迎阅读《果实乐趣手册》！\\\n\\\n这本书记录了 Fruitful Fun 模组的种种玩法：\\\n果树、养蜂、仪式、工具与烹饪。\\\n\\\n有些内容需要你亲自去发现。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.name": "果树",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.description": "从种植到杂交，一步步培育出所有果树。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.name": "新树种的获取",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.description": "树苗的来源与杂交方法。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.intro.title": "寻找树苗",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.intro.text": "模组中的果树不会凭空出现。\\\n\\\n大多数树苗可以从流浪商人处购买，也有一部分就生长在世界各地的果树之下。\\\n\\\n而某些特殊树种，只能靠你亲手培育。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.apple.title": "特别的苹果",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.apple.text": "苹果树苗不会在世界中自然生成。\\\n\\\n据说……把东西递给村民家的小孩子，会有意想不到的收获。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.hybrid.title": "杂交与授粉",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.getting_new_trees.hybrid.text": "更多的新树种需要借助蜜蜂来完成杂交。\\\n\\\n让蜜蜂携带不同来源的花粉为果树授粉，就可能得到全新的树种。\\\n\\\n具体方法见 [养蜂](category://fruitfulfun:guide/beekeeping) 章节。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.planting.name": "果树种植",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.planting.description": "种植、生长与收获。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.planting.planting.title": "种植与生长",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.planting.planting.text": "像种植原版树木一样种下树苗，等待它慢慢长大。\\\n\\\n果实成熟后，树叶会挂上果子，右击即可采摘。\\\n\\\n光照充足、空间足够时，果树会长得更快。\\\n\\\n如果没有蜜蜂授粉，果树最终会停止结果；有些果树甚至必须靠蜜蜂授粉才能结果，详见 [养蜂](category://fruitfulfun:guide/beekeeping) 章节。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.planting.harvesting.title": "快捷收获",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.fruit_tree.planting.harvesting.text": "除了手动采摘，你还可以用号角收获。\\\n\\\n吹响特定的号角，周围果树上的果实会全部落下。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.name": "养蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.description": "蜜蜂不仅酿蜜，还能帮你培育新树种。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.bee_intro.name": "认识蜜蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.bee_intro.description": "蜜蜂的全新玩法。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.bee_intro.intro.title": "蜜蜂的新面貌",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.bee_intro.intro.text": "本模组为蜜蜂添加了全新的玩法。\\\n\\\n蜜蜂可以采集花粉、记住花粉的来源，并为你授粉出新的果树。\\\n\\\n用蜜脾就能把蜜蜂从蜂巢里带出来，方便转移蜂群。\\\n\\\n蜜蜂会慢慢自行恢复生命，新出生的蜜蜂还会随机获得一个名字。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.inspector.name": "嗡嗡分析仪",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.inspector.description": "研究蜜蜂特性与基因的必备工具。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.inspector.intro.title": "研究蜜蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.inspector.intro.text": "嗡嗡分析仪是研究蜜蜂的必备工具。\\\n\\\n对蜜蜂使用，可以看到它的特性与携带的花粉。\\\n\\\n副手拿一本书与笔，再对蜜蜂使用，可以把记录写进书里。\\\n\\\n对书架使用，可以为基因命名；配合香薰蜡烛，对方块使用还能查看残留的气味。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.traits.name": "蜜蜂特性",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.traits.description": "能力与性格的差异。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.traits.intro.title": "特性与基因",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.traits.intro.text": "蜜蜂的特性决定了它们的能力与性格。\\\n\\\n有些蜜蜂跑得更快，有些性情温和，有些甚至能当坐骑。\\\n\\\n每个世界里蜜蜂的基因代码都是随机生成的，效果需要你亲自摸索。\\\n\\\n安装 Jade 模组可以获得更直观的基因与花粉信息。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.hybridizing.name": "授粉与杂交",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.hybridizing.description": "用花粉培育全新的树种。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.hybridizing.pollen.title": "花粉与授粉",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.hybridizing.pollen.text": "蜜蜂会记住自己采集过的花粉。\\\n\\\n当它带着特定组合的花粉为另一棵树授粉时，就有可能结出全新的树种。\\\n\\\n拥有「高级授粉」特性的蜜蜂，能解锁更稀有的杂交配方。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.hybridizing.examples.title": "一点提示",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.hybridizing.examples.text": "同一个树族之间相互杂交，往往就能诞生新的成员。\\\n\\\n试试让蜜蜂在不同品种的树叶之间往返，再观察果树的反应。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.riding.name": "骑乘蜜蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.riding.description": "骑着蜜蜂翱翔天际。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.riding.intro.title": "骑蜂飞行",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.riding.intro.text": "只有你自己繁殖出来的、拥有「可骑乘」特性的蜜蜂才允许装鞍，幼蜂不行。\\\n\\\n飞行高度有限制：雨天无法飞行，某些群系也限制了高度。\\\n\\\n用剪刀可以卸下鞍。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.haunting.name": "闹鬼与鬼魂蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.haunting.description": "附身与操控的奇妙能力。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.haunting.intro.title": "鬼魂蜂的秘密",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.haunting.intro.text": "鬼魂蜂能让你的灵魂「附身」到其他生物身上，从它们的视角行动。\\\n\\\n粉红蜂还藏着属于自己的特殊技能。\\\n\\\n至于如何得到鬼魂蜂——见 [仪式](category://fruitfulfun:guide/ritual) 章节。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.merchants.name": "商人与蜜蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.merchants.description": "从商人手中获得树苗与蜂箱。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.merchants.intro.title": "从商人手中获得蜜蜂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.merchants.intro.text": "流浪商人偶尔会出售珍贵的树苗。\\\n\\\n养蜂人村民会出售蜂箱。\\\n\\\n若世界中找不到养蜂人，流浪商人会代为出售蜂箱。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.mutagen.name": "突变剂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.mutagen.description": "让蜜蜂的后代更容易变异。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.mutagen.intro.title": "酿造突变剂",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.beekeeping.mutagen.intro.text": "在酿造台上酿造突变剂，然后喂给蜜蜂。\\\n\\\n受到影响的蜜蜂，产下的后代更容易发生变异。\\\n\\\n酿坏的突变剂没法使用，但可以回收成玻璃瓶。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.name": "仪式",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.description": "用龙首与烛光举行古老的仪式。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.dragon_ritual.name": "龙之仪式",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.dragon_ritual.description": "搭建阵型，转化物品。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.dragon_ritual.intro.title": "搭建阵型",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.dragon_ritual.intro.text": "在平坦的地面上摆好阵型：\\\n中央放一块完整的紫颂果派\\\n一个（或多个）龙首朝向中央\\\n四周按图摆放点燃的蜡烛\\\n\\\n支撑方块是什么并不重要。\\\n\\\n把物品投入中央，仪式会将其转化为另一种物品。\\\n\\\n龙首越多，产出的龙息越多。仪式进行时会生成危险的龙息，当心别靠太近！",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.dragon_ritual.multiblock.text": "图中展示了完整的仪式结构。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.ritual_recipes.name": "仪式配方",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.ritual_recipes.description": "已知的仪式配方一览。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.ritual_recipes.intro.title": "已知的配方",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.ritual.ritual_recipes.intro.text": "仪式可以把普通物品转化为稀有之物。以下是一些已为人知的配方：\\\n\\\n玻璃瓶 → 龙息\\\n酿造台 → 酿造机\\\n阳光探测器 → 雨探测器\\\n石榴 → 附魔石榴\\\n蜂箱（夜晚的苍白花园）→ 鬼魂蜂\\\n\\\n还有更多配方等待你去发现。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.name": "工具",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.description": "实用的机器与装备，让农业更高效。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_crafter.name": "嗡嗡合成台",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_crafter.description": "蜜蜂驱动的自动合成台。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_crafter.intro.title": "蜜蜂驱动的合成台",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_crafter.intro.text": "嗡嗡合成台能收集归巢蜜蜂的能量，并利用这份能量自动完成合成。\\\n\\\n归巢的蜜蜂越多、越勤快，它就转得越快。\\\n\\\n右击顶部可以放入材料，空手点击可以取出产物。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_shield.name": "嗡嗡盾牌",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_shield.description": "召唤蜜蜂反击的盾牌。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_shield.intro.title": "蜜蜂之盾",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.buzzy_shield.intro.text": "一面由蜜蜂驱动的盾牌。\\\n\\\n完美格挡（刚举盾的瞬间）会击退周围的敌人，并召唤蜜蜂反击攻击者。\\\n\\\n每次格挡都会消耗能量，注意盾牌上的电量显示。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.scented_candles.name": "香薰蜡烛",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.scented_candles.description": "用气味影响周围的生物。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.scented_candles.intro.title": "气味的力量",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.scented_candles.intro.text": "点燃不同的香薰蜡烛，会散发出不同的气味，影响周围的生物：\\\n向日葵味：防止幻翼生成\\\n樱桃味：防止流浪商人生成\\\n瓶子草味：阻止传送与末影人搬方块\\\n郁金香味：削弱生物，并让效果持续时间翻倍\\\n玫瑰味：防止敌对生物与蝙蝠生成\\\n\\\n它们由蜡烛与对应的植物在锻造台中合成。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.brewer.name": "酿造机",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.brewer.description": "自动酿造并加速的酿造机。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.brewer.intro.title": "自动酿造",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.brewer.intro.text": "通过龙之仪式，酿造台会转化为酿造机（见 [仪式](category://fruitfulfun:guide/ritual) 章节）。\\\n\\\n酿造机会把产物自动输送到下方的容器。\\\n\\\n持续酿造同一种产物，它还会越酿越快，最高提速 100%。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.rain_detector.name": "雨探测器",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.rain_detector.description": "检测降雨的红石方块。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.rain_detector.intro.title": "探测降雨",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.tools.rain_detector.intro.text": "通过龙之仪式获得（见 [仪式](category://fruitfulfun:guide/ritual) 章节）。\\\n\\\n它会像阳光探测器一样输出红石信号，只不过检测的是降雨而非阳光。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.name": "烹饪",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.description": "把丰收的果实变成美味佳肴。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.fruit_eating.name": "水果的食用",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.fruit_eating.description": "直接食用水果的种种妙用。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.fruit_eating.intro.title": "水果的妙用",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.fruit_eating.intro.text": "模组的果实都能直接食用。\\\n\\\n柠檬的食用速度最快。\\\n\\\n食用柑橘类水果可以扑灭身上的火焰。\\\n\\\n红心果能少量回复生命，并加速生物的繁殖冷却。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.name": "甜点与正餐",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.description": "把果实变成美味料理。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.intro.title": "丰收的料理",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.intro.text": "用收获的果实制作各种甜点与正餐。\\\n\\\n若安装了农夫乐事（Farmer's Delight），西柚意式奶冻、蜂蜜柚子茶与水果竹筒饭需要使用烹饪锅制作。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.grapefruit_panna_cotta.text": "用西柚、奶油、鸡蛋、明胶与糖制成的丝滑奶冻。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.grapefruit_panna_cotta.title": "西柚意式奶冻",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.donauwelle.title": "多瑙河之波",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.honey_pomelo_tea.text": "用柚子与蜂蜜泡成的热饮，饮用后可以清除有害效果。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.honey_pomelo_tea.title": "蜂蜜柚子茶",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.rice_with_fruits.text": "用竹筒蒸熟的米饭，混入各色水果，清香可口。",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.rice_with_fruits.title": "水果竹筒饭",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.lemon_roast_chicken.title": "柠檬烤鸡",
	"book.fruitfulfun.guide.cooking.dishes.chorus_fruit_pie.title": "紫颂果派"
}